<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PresMed says in talks.</title>
<headline>PresMed says in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Medical Investments Ltd (PresMed) said on Friday it was in talks which if successfully concluded may have an effect on the price of its shares and convertible debentures.</p>
<p>PresMed security holders were advised to exercise caution when dealing in these instruments.</p>
<p>A further announcement will be made during November, PresMed said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
